        {
          "id": "step-2.1",
          "step": "2.1",
          "claim": "A tuple in $SL_2(\\mathbb C)^n$ satisfies all these matrix equations exactly when its generator assignment extends to a homomorphism from the presented group $G$. Hence their common zero set is precisely $\\operatorname{Hom}(G,SL_2(\\mathbb C))$, a closed algebraic subset of affine space.",
